      "location": "§21",
      "proposalQuote": "We will provide various reports for the use of State.",
      "explanation": "The client requires regular project monitoring and weekly status reports to ensure oversight, which is undermined by indefinite reporting commitments.",
      "fix": "Replace the vague statement with a clear commitment to provide weekly project implementation progress reports to the State's Project Manager."
    },
