      "type": "VAGUENESS",
      "severity": "HIGH",
      "location": "§14",
      "proposalQuote": "Specify the formats provided (e.g., PDFs, online help, video tutorials).",
      "explanation": "The state requires a defined training and documentation plan to ensure operational self-sufficiency, but the proposal merely leaves unedited prompt instructions.",
      "fix": "Provide a concrete training and documentation plan detailing the specific formats and delivery schedules for administrator and end-user handoff."
    }
  ],
